OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny intervals and showers,
OL,6,Fthe showers quite heavy - and quite
OL,7,Ffrequent for a time in the morning -
OL,8,Fbut passing through quickly. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening, these showers
OL,13,Fbecoming light and more isolated
OL,14,Fovernight. Fresh westerly winds at
OL,15,Ffirst will ease through the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,18,Fisolated light showers in the morning,
OL,19,Fbecoming dry in the afternoon. Turning
OL,20,Fcloudy in the evening with some rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
